# The paper's environment: foldmap's runtime dependencies at the versions the paper's results were measured and drawn
# with (the runner's .venv, Python 3.13.13, 2026-10-25), their own
# dependencies pinned the same way. foldmap itself is installed from the release checkout on top:
#   pip install --require-hashes -r scripts/paper/requirements.lock && pip install --no-deps .
# Rebuild the lock after changing this file (uv 0.4 or later):
#   uv pip compile scripts/paper/requirements.in --universal --python-version 3.13 --generate-hashes -o scripts/paper/requirements.lock
